WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.643
Keep the sender with the message
Coordinator is waiting for Worker’s API review.

2
00:00:02.643 --> 00:00:07.242
See who sent the update
Worker’s report appears with its name and a link back to its terminal.

3
00:00:07.242 --> 00:00:11.826
Open the source
One action takes you to the terminal that sent the message.

4
00:00:11.826 --> 00:00:15.367
Back at the source
Worker’s own conversation is open, ready for review or a follow-up.

5
00:00:16.694 --> 00:00:19.385
Source links work on mobile too
The same sender label and source action, in a phone-sized browser.

6
00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:21.580
Tap to return to Worker
One action takes you to the terminal that sent the message.

7
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.900
Back at the source
Worker’s own conversation is open, ready for review or a follow-up.
